        "text_hRd38H": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>When you become a Lucky Penny Kitties foster, you're doing so much more than opening your home—you’re giving an animal a second chance at life.</strong> Whether you're caring for a tiny bottle baby, a frightened stray, a recovering medical case, or a senior cat searching for comfort, your kindness provides the love, safety, and stability they need to heal. Every foster home becomes the bridge between rescue and a forever family. Because of compassionate people like you, countless animals experience hope, healing, and the opportunity to begin again. Together, we're not just saving lives—we're building a more compassionate community, one animal at a time.</p><h2><strong>How to Become a Foster</strong></h2><p>Getting started is easy! Simply complete our <strong>Foster Application</strong>, and a member of the Lucky Penny Kitties team will review your application and contact you within <strong>24–48 hours</strong>.</p><p>As part of our approval process, <strong>all foster applicants are required to complete a home inspection</strong> before a cat or kitten is placed in their care. This helps us ensure every animal is entering a safe, secure, and loving environment where they can thrive.</p><p>Once approved, we'll work with you to find a foster cat or kitten that best matches your home, experience, and comfort level. Whether you can foster for a few weeks or several months, every foster home makes a life-saving difference.</p><p><strong>By opening your home, you're opening the door to hope, healing, and a brighter future for an animal in need. Thank you for becoming part of the Lucky Penny Kitties family.</strong> ❤️🐾</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
